{"suttaId":"thag5.5","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Th","vriCode":"s0508m.mul","paras":[1572,1588],"vripara":"335"},"segments":{"thag5.5:0.4":"Vaḍḍhattheragāthā","thag5.5:1.1":"“Sādhū hi kira me mātā, patodaṃ upadaṃsayi;","thag5.5:1.3":"Yassāhaṃ vacanaṃ sutvā, anusiṭṭho janettiyā;","thag5.5:1.5":"Āraddhavīriyo pahitatto, patto sambodhimuttamaṃ.","thag5.5:2.1":"“Arahā dakkhiṇeyyomhi, tevijjo amataddaso;","thag5.5:2.3":"Jetvā namucino senaṃ, viharāmi anāsavo.","thag5.5:3.1":"“Ajjhattañca bahiddhā ca, ye me vijjiṃsu āsavā;","thag5.5:3.3":"Sabbe asesā ucchinnā, na ca uppajjare puna.","thag5.5:4.1":"“Visāradā kho bhaginī, etamatthaṃ abhāsayi;","thag5.5:4.3":"‘Apihā nūna mayipi, vanatho te na vijjati’.","thag5.5:5.1":"“Pariyantakataṃ dukkhaṃ, antimoyaṃ samussayo;","thag5.5:5.3":"Jātimaraṇasaṃsāro, natthi dāni punabbhavo”ti.","thag5.5:5.5":"… Vaḍḍho thero …."},"attha":null,"tika":null}
